---
import { siteData } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="tentang" class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="about-header">
      <div class="section-tag">
        <span class="pixel-indicator">■</span>
        <span>01 // PROFIL & REALITA</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="about-heading" class="section-title">
        Bukan Studio Raksasa. <br />
        <span class="title-sub">Hanya Ruang Santai yang Jujur.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      
      <!-- Big Statement Box: The Bio & Voice -->
      <div class="statement-card">
        <div class="card-corner tl"></div>
        <div class="card-corner tr"></div>
        <div class="card-corner bl"></div>
        <div class="card-corner br"></div>

        <span class="mono-label">VERBATIM BIO</span>
        <blockquote class="verbatim-quote">
          "{siteData.bioVerbatim}"
        </blockquote>
        
        <p class="statement-text">
          Di balik nama <strong>{siteData.displayName}</strong>, tidak ada agenda korporat atau tim produksi mewah. Kiiow adalah streamer kecil yang menyukai dunia Minecraft—membangun balok, bertualang, dan mengobrol apa adanya bersama siapa pun yang mampir.
        </p>

        <div class="identity-specs">
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-key">Identitas</span>
            <span class="spec-val">{siteData.displayName}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-key">Fokus Kreatif</span>
            <span class="spec-val">Minecraft Gameplay & Chill Hangout</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-key">Pendekatan Visual</span>
            <span class="spec-val">Clean Pure-White Aesthetic</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Asymmetric Secondary Column: Real Principles -->
      <div class="values-column">
        
        <article class="principle-item">
          <div class="principle-header">
            <span class="principle-num">01</span>
            <h3 class="principle-title">Kecil Itu Nyaman</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="principle-desc">
            Komunitas yang belum terlalu padat punya kehangatan sendiri. Setiap pesan terbaca, setiap obrolan bermakna, dan kamu bukan sekadar angka di viewer counter.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="principle-item">
          <div class="principle-header">
            <span class="principle-num">02</span>
            <h3 class="principle-title">Bermain Tanpa Tekanan</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="principle-desc">
            Tidak ada gameplay yang harus sempurna. Kita nikmati proses menambang, membangun rumah kubus, atau sekadar menjelajahi lanskap voxel bersama-sama.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="principle-item">
          <div class="principle-header">
            <span class="principle-num">03</span>
            <h3 class="principle-title">Dukungan Nyata</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="principle-desc">
            Dukungan teman-teman lewat SociaBuzz langsung membantu kelangsungan stream dan alat berkarya kiiow untuk terus bisa menyapa kalian.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding-block: var(--space-20);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-deep);
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-lavender);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .pixel-indicator {
    color: var(--color-violet);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .title-sub {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  /* Statement Card with Pixel Corner Notches */
  .statement-card {
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .card-corner {
    position: absolute;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: var(--color-violet);
  }
  .card-corner.tl { top: -2px; left: -2px; }
  .card-corner.tr { top: -2px; right: -2px; }
  .card-corner.bl { bottom: -2px; left: -2px; }
  .card-corner.br { bottom: -2px; right: -2px; }

  .verbatim-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-block: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .statement-text {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .statement-text strong {
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .identity-specs {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .spec-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .spec-key {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .spec-val {
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* Principles Column */
  .values-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .principle-item {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-bounce);
  }

  .principle-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-violet);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .principle-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .principle-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-violet);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .principle-title {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .principle-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

